OL,3,GNEWSA'We lock shop doors during opening
OL,4,Ahours after theft'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop owner has described how she
OL,7,Flocks her door during opening hours and
OL,8,Fcustomers have to ring the bell to get
OL,9,Fin after her store was targeted by
OL,10,Fthieves last year.
OL,12,FPaige Mengers, who runs a designer
OL,13,Fboutique in Surrey, has been speaking
OL,14,Fabout the impact of shoplifting, with
OL,15,Frecorded offences remaining above
OL,16,Fpre-pandemic levels.
OL,18,FHome Office figures show there were
OL,19,F42,674 shoplifting offences across
OL,20,FKent, Surrey and Sussex in 2025/26
OL,21,Fcompared with 28,048 cases in 2019/20.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
